// Mapbox PUBLIC runtime token (TEMPLATE — committed, no real secret).
//
// The map needs a PUBLIC access token (starts with "pk.") at RUNTIME to load
// map tiles and styles. This is DIFFERENT from the secret sk. download token
// in ~/.netrc (see netrc.template) used only at build time.
//
// SETUP (one time, per developer machine):
//   1. Copy this file to iosApp/Mapbox.xcconfig (same folder, drop ".template"):
//        cp iosApp/Mapbox.xcconfig.template iosApp/Mapbox.xcconfig
//   2. Replace pk.PLACEHOLDER below with your real PUBLIC (pk.) token.
//   3. The real iosApp/Mapbox.xcconfig is gitignored — never commit the token.
//
// Configuration/Config.xcconfig #includes iosApp/Mapbox.xcconfig and the value
// is surfaced into Info.plist as the `MBXAccessToken` key, which the Mapbox SDK
// reads automatically at launch. We do NOT hardcode the token in Swift.

MAPBOX_PUBLIC_TOKEN = pk.PLACEHOLDER
